  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Nand Lal Gupta vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Food ... on 20 December, 2024 Author: Alok Mathur Bench: Alok Mathur High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:85965 Court No. - 6 Case :- Writ - A No. - 12574 of 2024 Petitioner :- Nand Lal Gupta Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Food Safety And Drug Administration Deptt.",
    "facts": "2. The grievance of the petitioner is with regard to payment of his medical reimbursement claim which was submitted to Assistant Commissioner (Food) Grade II, Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, District Hamirpur. While processing the claims, the Commissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administration, Lucknow had sought certain clarifications from respondent No. 4 on 27.05.2024 which are pending at his end and due to which the medical reimbursement dues has not been paid to the petitioner.",
    "arguments": "3. After arguing the matter at some length, learned counsel for petitioner submits that that grievance of the petitioner shall be substantially redressed in case Commissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administration, Lucknow is directed to process the papers of the petitioner and make the payment of medical reimbursement claim expeditiously."
  },
